WEBVTT

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:30.776
Well, I'm going to use today
the Social Progress Index.

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:33.896
It's a measure of
the quality of life of countries,

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:36.936
ranging from the basic
needs of survival --

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:39.736
food, water, shelter, safety --

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:42.016
through to the foundations
of well-being --

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.376
education, information,
health and the environment --

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:46.976
and opportunity --

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:52.000
rights, freedom of choice, inclusiveness
and access to higher education.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.736
Now, the Social Progress Index
doesn't look like the SDGs,

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.096
but fundamentally,
it's measuring the same concepts,